# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are documented in this file.

This file is assembled on each `v*` tag release (see `.forgejo/workflows/release.yml`):

- `.release-notes/vX.Y.Z.md` provides the human-written `Summary` and `Upgrade Notes`.
- [git-cliff](https://git-cliff.org) generates the automated `Changes` section.

Before the first release it is just this seed.
